{c: Verse 1}
[C] Enrique da hero sun [Am] sunke,        Tainu [F] karna pyar sikh [C] da
[C] Munda jattan da ni onh [Am] balliye,        Tere [F] karke guitar [C] sikhda
[C] Jeb meri khaali paisa [Am] ik vi nahi,        [C] Tere dad wangu dad mera [Am] rich vi nahi
